{"id":198,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Widely shunned as a bearer of ill fortune. Upon crossing paths with this creature, I've been told one must chant ”Workrum, Workrum—bad luck, don't come” as a protective incantation."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It searches for shiny things for its boss. Murkrow’s presence is said to be unlucky, so many people detest it."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It has a weakness for shiny things. It’s been known to sneak into the nests of Gabite—noted collectors of jewels—in search of treasure."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Seen as a symbol of bad luck, it’s generally disliked. Yet it gives presents—objects that sparkle or shine—to Trainers it’s close to."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"They awaken at dusk and take wing in the twilight, leading to the expression, “Get home before the Murkrow fly.”"},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Murkrow was feared and loathed as the alleged bearer of ill fortune. This Pokémon shows strong interest in anything that sparkles or glitters. It will even try to steal rings from women."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Feared and loathed by many, it is believed to bring misfortune to all those who see it at night."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"It hides any shiny object it finds in a secret location. Murkrow and Meowth loot one another’s stashes."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it then lose the pursuer on mountain trails."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It is said that when chased, it lures its attacker onto dark mountain trails where the foe will get lost."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It appears near travelers to lure them into deep forests. It is said to carry misfortune."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It is believed that seeing this Pokémon at night will bring about ominous occurrences."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"MURKROW were feared as the alleged bearers of ill fortune. It shows strong interest in anything that sparkles. It will even try to steal rings from women."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Insomnia","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's insomnia prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Super Luck","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is so lucky that the critical-hit ratios of its moves are boosted."},{"name":"Prankster","hidden":true,"description":"Gives priority to the Pokémon's status moves."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"forest","color":"Black","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":198,"name":"Murkrow","condition":null,"children":[{"id":430,"name":"Honchkrow","condition":"Use Dusk Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,64],[1,310],[5,16],[11,114],[15,17],[21,101],[25,372],[31,269],[35,212],[40,492],[50,389],[55,259],[60,511]],"machine":[512,332,314,403,413,347,109,399,38,814,203,263,297,19,492,416,114,257,506,542,63,196,808,189,417,101,182,94,917,240,156,184,247,214,555,180,164,241,366,36,269,851,168,86,369,253],"egg":[413,109,65,297,260,195,103,143,18],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv10-200","name":"Team Rocket's Murkrow","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"200","artist":null,"img":"sv10/200"},{"id":"me55-93","name":"Murkrow","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"93","artist":"Kouki Saitou","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-93/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-93/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-126","name":"Team Rocket's Murkrow","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","number":"126","artist":"Mugi Hamada","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-126/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-126/large"},{"id":"me2-57","name":"Murkrow","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Commo